/*
  Structured content for the ZUZU Engineering & Project Teams cluster.
  Same shape as the other cluster data files, rendered by the existing
  ClusterHub/ClusterPage templates -- zero new components.

  This cluster is deliberately distinct from the /industries/engineering-firms
  page (which covers engineering-firm back-office administration). These
  pages are about software/engineering DELIVERY work -- sprints, releases,
  capacity, and cross-team coordination -- viewed through ZUZU's existing
  activity, attendance, analytics and manager-workspace capabilities. No
  integrations with sprint boards, ticketing systems, version control,
  CI/CD, or project-management tools are implied anywhere below -- ZUZU
  has no visibility into that data. All claims are hedged and no stats,
  customers or case studies are invented.
*/

